  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.2 — Documentation update\n• README updated with v1.0.8 Core compatibility note and updated install commands\n• No functional changes — safe to upgrade from 1.0.1\nv1.0.1 — Bug fix\n• Log events now appear on disk immediately — every write is flushed to disk; previously Info/Debug/Warning events were buffered and only visible after Error/Critical or app stop\nv1.0.0 — Initial release\n• Rolling daily JSONL output — logs/appname-yyyy-MM-dd.jsonl\n• Immediate flush for Error / Critical events\n• CLEF-compatible structured output\nSee full changelog: https://github.com/SinkSharp/CHANGELOG.md",
